{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionNatBridge","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionNatBridge","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.DeltaLambdaSignRule","lean:module:Mathlib.Combinatorics.Enumerative.Partition"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionNatBridge.partitionEquivNatPartition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionNatBridge.partitionEquivNatPartition","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PartitionNatBridge.lean#L46-L68","doc":"**Custom `Partition n` ≃ `Nat.Partition n`.** The forward map coerces the sorted parts list\nto a multiset; the inverse sorts the multiset into a weakly-decreasing list. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionNatBridge.Partition.ext'","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionNatBridge.Partition.ext'","kind":"theorem","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/PartitionNatBridge.lean#L32-L44","doc":"Two custom partitions with equal `parts` lists are equal (the other three fields are\n`Prop`s, so proof-irrelevant).\n\nThe `Partition.` prefix here is **not** a namespace component — it is the *type* name, which\nis what lets `QOU.BraidKnot.PartitionReindex` call this as\n`PartitionNatBridge.Partition.ext'`. The LWC-2 namespace sweep (`22728b8801`) stripped it,\nwhich broke both call sites in `PartitionReindex` and the `apply` below; restored here.\n\nThe proof now delegates to `DeltaLambdaSignRule.Partition.ext`, the `@[ext]` lemma that lives\nwith the structure itself. This declaration is kept as the name `PartitionReindex` already\nuses. ","signatureChunk":0}]}